  "fullDescription": "Soft Botanical Elements Watercolor Clipart, Floral PNG Collection, Wildflower Bouquet, Botanical Leaves, Rose, Hibiscus, Daisy, Hydrangea\n\nAdd a soft, elegant botanical touch to your creative projects with this Soft Botanical Elements Watercolor Clipart Collection. This beautiful floral set features delicate watercolor flowers, lush greenery, botanical leaves, berries, and romantic floral arrangements in a rich combination of blue, pink, purple, white, black, coral, and neutral tones.\n\nThe collection includes detailed roses, hibiscus, gerbera daisies, hydrangeas, pansies, peony-style flowers, wildflowers, small daisies, berries, ferns, eucalyptus-style foliage, and tropical-inspired leaves. The hand-painted watercolor appearance makes these elements ideal for creating elegant and feminine designs.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nWedding invitations and stationery\nFloral wedding decorations\nGreeting cards and invitations\nScrapbooking and journaling\nPlanner and printable designs\nStickers and labels\nT-shirt and apparel designs\nSublimation projects\nWall art and posters\nLogo and branding designs\nDigital paper and craft projects\nSocial media graphics\nFloral wreaths and bouquets\nDIY stationery and handmade projects\n\nCreate beautiful floral compositions, borders, wreaths, bouquets, wedding stationery, and botanical artwork with these versatile watercolor elements.\n\nFlowers & Botanical Names\n\nRose, White Rose, Blue Rose, Hibiscus, Gerbera Daisy, Hydrangea, Pansy, Peony-Style Flower, Coral Flower, Pink Daisy, White Daisy, Blue Daisy, Purple Flower, Black Hibiscus, Pink Hibiscus, Small Wildflowers, Blue Delphinium-Style Flowers, Lavender-Style Blooms, Baby’s Breath-Style Flowers, Berries, Fern Leaves, Eucalyptus-Style Leaves, Palm Leaves, Botanical Foliage, Greenery.",
